OL,4,CPaolo Bulgari dies aged 89           W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GItalian jeweller Paolo Bulgari, who  W5
OL,7,Ghelped turn his family's business    W5
OL,8,Ginto a global luxury brand, has died W5
OL,9,Gin Rome aged age 89.                 W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GHis family announced the news,       W5
OL,12,Gremembering him as "the greatest     W5
OL,13,Gjeweller of our time", according to  W5
OL,14,GItalian media.                       W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GPaolo Bulgari was Chairman of the    W5
OL,17,GBvlgari Group since 1984 and its     W5
OL,18,Gjewellery pieces have adorned        W5
OL,19,GHollywood stars and royalty          W5
OL,20,Gincluding Diana, Princess of Wales.  W5
OL,21,                                      W5
